<title>JAPAN: Japan to auction 6-mth T-bills on Thursday-traders.</title>
<headline>Japan to auction 6-mth T-bills on Thursday-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance is likely to offer six-month Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on Thursday, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The offer volume is likely to be 1.2 trillion yen, because the new T-bills are expected to roll over that amount of an earlier issue of six-month T-bills maturing on September 10, they said.</p>
</text>
